estion" "q-35846" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "To find the state vector ${x}_{2},$ we apply two steps of the Markov chain:\n\n$$\n{x}_{1}=P{x}_{0},\\,{x}_{2}=P{x}_{1}\n$$\n\nAfter the first step, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & =P{x}_{0} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0.2 & 0.5 \\\\ 0.8 & 0.5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0.7 \\\\ 0.3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0.29 \\\\ 0.71\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, after the second step, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2} & =P{x}_{1} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0.2 & 0.5 \\\\ 0.8 & 0.5\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0.29 \\\\ 0.71\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}0.413 \\\\ 0.587\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14059948/state.json" "file_sha256" "79004fa3fa51cf2a2777d0ed4ba28f70a7776f2ba9a7a98f4f8794d869078062"} {"question" "q-35846" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/hard "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14059948/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "7ef70fe7b4b12a5ec69f5ea1dc190f1f351f350f2f30415b1235ad1687b3058d"} {"question" "q-35846" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14059948/state.json" "file_sha256" "79004fa3fa51cf2a2777d0ed4ba28f70a7776f2ba9a7a98f4f8794d869078062"} {"question" "q-35846" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "[\\begin{aligned}0.393 \\\\ 0.607\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}0.413 \\\\ 0.587\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}0.442 \\\\ 0.558\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}0.526 \\\\ 0.474\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}0.611 \\\\ 